(3537652, 495422, 73747, '<td valign="top">What an exciting mix of all the various colors!  Good choice for a night shot and very clear and crispy image.</td>', 'What an exciting mix of all the various colors!  Good choice for a night shot and very clear and crispy image.', '2007-04-11 02:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
