(3537658, 496128, 76198, '<td valign="top">Wow. Best yet. Hands down. I love how nighttime lighting can create a surreal effect - this nails it. Awesome.</td>', 'Wow. Best yet. Hands down. I love how nighttime lighting can create a surreal effect - this nails it. Awesome.', '2007-04-11 03:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
