(3539728, 493152, 45857, '<td valign="top">like the colors you have working here</td>', 'like the colors you have working here', '2007-04-11 14:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539738, 495618, 45857, '<td valign="top">a bold original approach</td>', 'a bold original approach', '2007-04-11 14:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539749, 495163, 45857, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite comfortable with that much foreground, but its a fascinating image</td>', 'I''m not quite comfortable with that much foreground, but its a fascinating image', '2007-04-11 14:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539752, 494940, 57202, '<td valign="top">I love the blue tones here, but I wish it were a bit brighter and a bit sharper (I usually bring a hand-held spotlight with me to shine at a point I want to focus on).  Of course the lack of sharpness could just be the haze, but I thought I''d throw it out there.  Excellent composition though.  The shoreline leads your eye into the shot. :)</td>', 'I love the blue tones here, but I wish it were a bit brighter and a bit sharper (I usually bring a hand-held spotlight with me to shine at a point I want to focus on).  Of course the lack of sharpness could just be the haze, but I thought I''d throw it out there.  Excellent composition though.  The shoreline leads your eye into the shot. :)', '2007-04-11 14:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539766, 495651, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of someone lighting a cigarette, but the fence and background seem a bit distracting to me.  If I had taken this type of shot, I probably would have used a black background and moved in much closer to the subject to fill the frame with her head and hands as she lit the cigarette.</td>', 'I like the concept of someone lighting a cigarette, but the fence and background seem a bit distracting to me.  If I had taken this type of shot, I probably would have used a black background and moved in much closer to the subject to fill the frame with her head and hands as she lit the cigarette.', '2007-04-11 14:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539770, 494044, 57202, '<td valign="top">Love the bursts of light! :)  I wonder what this shot would look like in color...</td>', 'Love the bursts of light! :)  I wonder what this shot would look like in color...', '2007-04-11 14:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539772, 496026, 76889, '<td valign="top">poor ligth...may be better withou flash...</td>', 'poor ligth...may be better withou flash...', '2007-04-11 14:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539775, 495621, 76889, '<td valign="top">withou focus...</td>', 'withou focus...', '2007-04-11 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539778, 496136, 57202, '<td valign="top">The composition is AWESOME, but it seems too dark to me.  Since the lights are going to be blown out anyway, I probably would have increased the exposure time to try and bring out more detail on the bench.</td>', 'The composition is AWESOME, but it seems too dark to me.  Since the lights are going to be blown out anyway, I probably would have increased the exposure time to try and bring out more detail on the bench.', '2007-04-11 14:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539794, 493754, 66497, '<td valign="top">Too soft</td>', 'Too soft', '2007-04-11 14:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539796, 494180, 66497, '<td valign="top">beautiful. great composition</td>', 'beautiful. great composition', '2007-04-11 14:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539803, 495975, 66497, '<td valign="top">lol large scale is right</td>', 'lol large scale is right', '2007-04-11 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539813, 496112, 70375, '<td valign="top">Nice and from a new angle too! I love the lights on the pier but I also like the light in the parking lot :)</td>', 'Nice and from a new angle too! I love the lights on the pier but I also like the light in the parking lot :)', '2007-04-11 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539825, 496118, 39679, '<td valign="top">the color is nice but it''s not strong enough to be the subject.</td>', 'the color is nice but it''s not strong enough to be the subject.', '2007-04-11 14:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539834, 495932, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the creative light-painting here, but the lighting is a bit uneven and slightly distracting.  Flashlights are good for smaller areas, but I''ve had better luck with using a flash for even lighting (especially with colored gels :) ).  Good composition though and very creative. :)</td>', 'I like the creative light-painting here, but the lighting is a bit uneven and slightly distracting.  Flashlights are good for smaller areas, but I''ve had better luck with using a flash for even lighting (especially with colored gels :) ).  Good composition though and very creative. :)', '2007-04-11 14:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539837, 495705, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the way the water looks here, but the lights seem a bit too harsh.  I might have done a slightly shorter exposure.  Also, it would have been awesome if you had lit the foreground rocks with a colored flash of some sort. :)</td>', 'I like the way the water looks here, but the lights seem a bit too harsh.  I might have done a slightly shorter exposure.  Also, it would have been awesome if you had lit the foreground rocks with a colored flash of some sort. :)', '2007-04-11 14:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539843, 495597, 57202, '<td valign="top">Good blackmail material, LOL!</td>', 'Good blackmail material, LOL!', '2007-04-11 14:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539849, 494085, 72317, '<td valign="top">..Come on.. Originality is part of it too. =/</td>', '..Come on.. Originality is part of it too. =/', '2007-04-11 14:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539852, 493754, 57202, '<td valign="top">The colors and the reflection off the windows are awesome, but I would have moved closer to the house to eliminate that distracting light from the frame.  It also seems just a tad noisy; I might have went with a lower ISO and longer exposure.</td>', 'The colors and the reflection off the windows are awesome, but I would have moved closer to the house to eliminate that distracting light from the frame.  It also seems just a tad noisy; I might have went with a lower ISO and longer exposure.', '2007-04-11 14:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539856, 496113, 72317, '<td valign="top">I really like this.. What are those colorful circles at the right hand side?<br/>Ten, anyways.</td>', 'I really like this.. What are those colorful circles at the right hand side?Ten, anyways.', '2007-04-11 14:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539857, 495986, 72317, '<td valign="top">Fantastic clarity.</td>', 'Fantastic clarity.', '2007-04-11 14:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539863, 495394, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like it. :)  Good choice of using a relatively short shutter speed to keep the stars looking like stars.</td>', 'I like it. :)  Good choice of using a relatively short shutter speed to keep the stars looking like stars.', '2007-04-11 15:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539871, 494372, 72317, '<td valign="top">That sure is a funny shaped moon..</td>', 'That sure is a funny shaped moon..', '2007-04-11 15:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539875, 494741, 72317, '<td valign="top">I have my monitor set to maximum brightness and I still don''t see much going on here..</td>', 'I have my monitor set to maximum brightness and I still don''t see much going on here..', '2007-04-11 15:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539876, 496049, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''m shocked at what great detail you captured of the trees!  Nice night image.  Reminds me of walking to my car after a night class.</td>', 'I''m shocked at what great detail you captured of the trees!  Nice night image.  Reminds me of walking to my car after a night class.', '2007-04-11 15:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539877, 495260, 72317, '<td valign="top">I''m loving the blue.. I''m guessing you used that little lightbulb icon setting thing.. Idk what it''s called.. But it looks great.</td>', 'I''m loving the blue.. I''m guessing you used that little lightbulb icon setting thing.. Idk what it''s called.. But it looks great.', '2007-04-11 15:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539881, 495877, 72317, '<td valign="top">Awwh. He looks sad. Nice picture. =)</td>', 'Awwh. He looks sad. Nice picture. =)', '2007-04-11 15:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539884, 494489, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice effect on the water with the longer shutter time.  I also like the lines, and star burst lights.</td>', 'Nice effect on the water with the longer shutter time.  I also like the lines, and star burst lights.', '2007-04-11 15:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539887, 494304, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a cute kid... you can feel his imagination.  I just wish his other arm wasn''t "missing".</td>', 'What a cute kid... you can feel his imagination.  I just wish his other arm wasn''t "missing".', '2007-04-11 15:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539889, 495998, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love night shots of the Lincoln Memorial but I think you could have picked a better vantage point for this. I really find the lamp posts and the car lights distracting. 6 from me.</td>', 'I love night shots of the Lincoln Memorial but I think you could have picked a better vantage point for this. I really find the lamp posts and the car lights distracting. 6 from me.', '2007-04-11 15:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539894, 494809, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something unique.  She looks like she''s ready for an all nighter!</td>', 'Nice to see something unique.  She looks like she''s ready for an all nighter!', '2007-04-11 15:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539897, 496124, 70514, '<td valign="top">You really captured a lot of color and detail.  Very nice!</td>', 'You really captured a lot of color and detail.  Very nice!', '2007-04-11 15:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539902, 496124, 72317, '<td valign="top">Oooh. Nice clarity on the trees in the back. Was there a festival or something going on back there?</td>', 'Oooh. Nice clarity on the trees in the back. Was there a festival or something going on back there?', '2007-04-11 15:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539906, 492936, 72317, '<td valign="top">Blue light kinda looks like a dragon. =)</td>', 'Blue light kinda looks like a dragon. =)', '2007-04-11 15:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539908, 495708, 72317, '<td valign="top">I love the color combination in the sky. Fantastic.</td>', 'I love the color combination in the sky. Fantastic.', '2007-04-11 15:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539910, 496057, 70514, '<td valign="top">LOVE baseball!</td>', 'LOVE baseball!', '2007-04-11 15:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539913, 494697, 70514, '<td valign="top">Ooooo... very eerie.  And serene.</td>', 'Ooooo... very eerie.  And serene.', '2007-04-11 15:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539916, 495176, 72317, '<td valign="top">Face looks a little white.. But it isn''t that bad. Overall I really like this.</td>', 'Face looks a little white.. But it isn''t that bad. Overall I really like this.', '2007-04-11 15:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539922, 496055, 72317, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh. Clothing. Please. &gt;.&lt;</td>', 'Ahhhh. Clothing. Please. >.<', '2007-04-11 15:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539924, 496035, 39679, '<td valign="top">I wish this were just a bit brighter.</td>', 'I wish this were just a bit brighter.', '2007-04-11 15:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539925, 493701, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but feel it could have framed a little better (i.e. to include the top of the column of water).  The flash does a good job of freezing the action, but I personally feel that the shot lacks a central focus...</td>', 'I like the concept, but feel it could have framed a little better (i.e. to include the top of the column of water).  The flash does a good job of freezing the action, but I personally feel that the shot lacks a central focus...', '2007-04-11 15:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539931, 496124, 57202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  The colors in the sky balance out well with the trees and water.</td>', 'Beautiful!  The colors in the sky balance out well with the trees and water.', '2007-04-11 15:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539940, 494741, 57202, '<td valign="top">From the very dim posts, I can see that this composition had potential.  However, it is WAY too dark.  Next time, try doing a much longer exposure.</td>', 'From the very dim posts, I can see that this composition had potential.  However, it is WAY too dark.  Next time, try doing a much longer exposure.', '2007-04-11 15:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539960, 496092, 57202, '<td valign="top">Cool old vehicle, but I feel like the highlights aren''t as bright as they could be.  I probably would have done a levels adjustment to help the snow look brighter.  Also, I probably would have composed this shot so that it wasn''t head-on.</td>', 'Cool old vehicle, but I feel like the highlights aren''t as bright as they could be.  I probably would have done a levels adjustment to help the snow look brighter.  Also, I probably would have composed this shot so that it wasn''t head-on.', '2007-04-11 15:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539966, 495794, 57202, '<td valign="top">The glow from a candle can make a great light source, but you have to be REALLY careful not to include the candle or you get blown-out highlights (like you have here).  Also, I find that it helps to reduce the color temperature closer to a Tungsten white balance to cool down the warm tones slightly.</td>', 'The glow from a candle can make a great light source, but you have to be REALLY careful not to include the candle or you get blown-out highlights (like you have here).  Also, I find that it helps to reduce the color temperature closer to a Tungsten white balance to cool down the warm tones slightly.', '2007-04-11 15:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539969, 493794, 57202, '<td valign="top">Though this shot is technically taken at night, it really lacks interest.  It looks to me like a snapshot taken with a flash.  One thing I can tell you is that voters are BRUTAL if they encounter photos that look like snapshots.  Try and use a creative composition and subject matter in the future.  Just my $.02. :)</td>', 'Though this shot is technically taken at night, it really lacks interest.  It looks to me like a snapshot taken with a flash.  One thing I can tell you is that voters are BRUTAL if they encounter photos that look like snapshots.  Try and use a creative composition and subject matter in the future.  Just my $.02. :)', '2007-04-11 15:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539973, 495389, 57202, '<td valign="top">The lower part of the frame is WAY too dark.  The sky looks like it may have made for a good potential sunset, but this shot doesn''t say "night" to me.  That very well could be the moon behind the hill, but it isn''t obvious to me.</td>', 'The lower part of the frame is WAY too dark.  The sky looks like it may have made for a good potential sunset, but this shot doesn''t say "night" to me.  That very well could be the moon behind the hill, but it isn''t obvious to me.', '2007-04-11 15:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539982, 494085, 46870, '<td valign="top">great shot 10</td>', 'great shot 10', '2007-04-11 15:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539985, 494706, 70103, '<td valign="top">it''s a little blurry</td>', 'it''s a little blurry', '2007-04-11 15:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539987, 494372, 70103, '<td valign="top">it''s a little too dark, would be better if more could be seen</td>', 'it''s a little too dark, would be better if more could be seen', '2007-04-11 15:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539993, 495351, 66952, '<td valign="top">San Diego! Cool!</td>', 'San Diego! Cool!', '2007-04-11 15:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3539995, 496092, 42100, '<td valign="top">Such a sad view of this ''37 Ford, somebody needs to be punished for neglecting a car that special.  The snow really adds some great character to the photo.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Such a sad view of this ''37 Ford, somebody needs to be punished for neglecting a car that special.  The snow really adds some great character to the photo.  Nicely done!', '2007-04-11 15:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3540042, 495587, 43156, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you shot from and composition isnt too bad, just too mach out of focus for the photocontest. 5</td>', 'I like the angle you shot from and composition isnt too bad, just too mach out of focus for the photocontest. 5', '2007-04-11 16:12:47.000000', NULL, 1);
