(3540917, 493685, 76373, '<td valign="top">Too much like a snapshot.  Remeber that lighting is pretty much everything.. aside from focus.  After that, the 5 rules and the secret 6th rule of cutting off limbs when they shouldn''t be need to be followed.  But I really would start with lighting and work from there.</td>', 'Too much like a snapshot.  Remeber that lighting is pretty much everything.. aside from focus.  After that, the 5 rules and the secret 6th rule of cutting off limbs when they shouldn''t be need to be followed.  But I really would start with lighting and work from there.', '2007-04-11 21:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
