(3541064, 494617, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully done.  I loke the light (moon) behind the clouds and the pale blue color.  Looks so cold.</td>', 'This is wonderfully done.  I loke the light (moon) behind the clouds and the pale blue color.  Looks so cold.', '2007-04-11 21:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541102, 495744, 72670, '<td valign="top">Very colorful! Great job on not blowing out all the lights. Very interested in seeing the shot specs on this one. A little more depth of field would of been nice IMO.One of my favs for this challenge.</td>', 'Very colorful! Great job on not blowing out all the lights. Very interested in seeing the shot specs on this one. A little more depth of field would of been nice IMO.One of my favs for this challenge.', '2007-04-11 22:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541109, 493755, 72670, '<td valign="top">A little sharper would of been nicer for me.Nice shot regardless!</td>', 'A little sharper would of been nicer for me.Nice shot regardless!', '2007-04-11 22:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541114, 495856, 72670, '<td valign="top">I like this but i think i would like to see this in colour. I am assuming the facades of the homes are of different from one tothe next? If not then i guess it would have been a little monochrome anyways.Nicely done.</td>', 'I like this but i think i would like to see this in colour. I am assuming the facades of the homes are of different from one tothe next? If not then i guess it would have been a little monochrome anyways.Nicely done.', '2007-04-11 22:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541121, 496046, 72670, '<td valign="top">This by far is the best of the northern lights in this challenge. The green does not overpower the shot, like the others. You can still see the blue in the sky and the reflection. Nice job. One of my favs for this challenge.</td>', 'This by far is the best of the northern lights in this challenge. The green does not overpower the shot, like the others. You can still see the blue in the sky and the reflection. Nice job. One of my favs for this challenge.', '2007-04-11 22:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541131, 494085, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I don''t like it as much as the recent ribbon winner but I still like it. Not even sure if it is by the same photographer. Some people in the forums are complaining about this image, saying if it is by the same photographer then that''s being lazy. I don''t see it that way at all. People form Iceland enter northern lights photos in back to back challenges all the time and no one ever says anything about them. I''ll give this a 9.</td>', 'Beautiful! I don''t like it as much as the recent ribbon winner but I still like it. Not even sure if it is by the same photographer. Some people in the forums are complaining about this image, saying if it is by the same photographer then that''s being lazy. I don''t see it that way at all. People form Iceland enter northern lights photos in back to back challenges all the time and no one ever says anything about them. I''ll give this a 9.', '2007-04-11 22:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541133, 495497, 43774, '<td valign="top">Well this is interesting! I see it has been validated already (that was quick). I guess this is a double exposure. It''s very clear, not bad!</td>', 'Well this is interesting! I see it has been validated already (that was quick). I guess this is a double exposure. It''s very clear, not bad!', '2007-04-11 22:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541134, 494180, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2007-04-11 22:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541151, 494094, 70514, '<td valign="top">Memories of childhood.  Thank you.  Very special, whether the light is only that bright or not.</td>', 'Memories of childhood.  Thank you.  Very special, whether the light is only that bright or not.', '2007-04-11 22:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541154, 495091, 70514, '<td valign="top">You don''t usually see skies in a "night" shot, huh?  Beautiful and original.</td>', 'You don''t usually see skies in a "night" shot, huh?  Beautiful and original.', '2007-04-11 22:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3541155, 492880, 51424, '<td valign="top">My little brother in-law is also on the USS Ronald Regan and so this shot was a great find for me, hope you all are well and thanks for all you do.</td>', 'My little brother in-law is also on the USS Ronald Regan and so this shot was a great find for me, hope you all are well and thanks for all you do.', '2007-04-11 22:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
