(3544148, 494052, 28070, '<td valign="top">Good pic, the tree is cool bent over.  Looks like a point and shoot to me.  Too much light up front.  What might have been cool would be to flash once and then have the shutter open for a time after to collect the light of the trees in the back.  Or no flash and just timed exposure.  Looks like a porch flood light though, don''t use that like this.</td>', 'Good pic, the tree is cool bent over.  Looks like a point and shoot to me.  Too much light up front.  What might have been cool would be to flash once and then have the shutter open for a time after to collect the light of the trees in the back.  Or no flash and just timed exposure.  Looks like a porch flood light though, don''t use that like this.', '2007-04-12 22:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
