(3544240, 495975, 61651, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I do find the much-darker bottom portion a bit distracting, although I''m not sure simply cropping out the bottom would improve things.  It might have been better to find a different angle that avoided the shrubs entirely.  In any case, I think you picked an excellent location for a night shot and captured it quite well.</td>', 'I really like this shot. I do find the much-darker bottom portion a bit distracting, although I''m not sure simply cropping out the bottom would improve things.  It might have been better to find a different angle that avoided the shrubs entirely.  In any case, I think you picked an excellent location for a night shot and captured it quite well.', '2007-04-12 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544260, 495744, 54540, '<td valign="top">Great colors, exposure and best of all, perspective.  Well done.<br/>Technical obsveration - the artifacts that appear around the wire that crosses the street are a sign of over sharpening from my experience.  I realize it''s basic editing only, otherwise you could have masked the sky and not sharpened it, as the buildings appear unaffected, in fact benefit from the sharpening.<br/>Well done.  Solid 7 from me!</td>', 'Great colors, exposure and best of all, perspective.  Well done.Technical obsveration - the artifacts that appear around the wire that crosses the street are a sign of over sharpening from my experience.  I realize it''s basic editing only, otherwise you could have masked the sky and not sharpened it, as the buildings appear unaffected, in fact benefit from the sharpening.Well done.  Solid 7 from me!', '2007-04-12 22:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544261, 495681, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very interesting shot - I like the composition, especially the way you captured the reflections in the water.  On my screen though, it looks over-sharpened, which for me detracts a bit from the overall effectiveness of the shot.</td>', 'I think this is a very interesting shot - I like the composition, especially the way you captured the reflections in the water.  On my screen though, it looks over-sharpened, which for me detracts a bit from the overall effectiveness of the shot.', '2007-04-12 22:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544264, 494180, 54540, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  One of my favorites of the bunch.<br/>(Would have been a good "anachronism" entry too!)<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Fantastic!  One of my favorites of the bunch.(Would have been a good "anachronism" entry too!) Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-04-12 23:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544270, 495595, 54540, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice on the crop - extra point!</td>', 'Excellent choice on the crop - extra point!', '2007-04-12 23:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544271, 494776, 61651, '<td valign="top">Your foreground choice is striking and makes this image more than just your ordinary cityscape shot - I like it.  I think if the colored reflections in the water had not been long enough to extend into your foreground, it might not have been as effective a shot - the reflections seem to serve the purpose of marrying the foreground to the background.</td>', 'Your foreground choice is striking and makes this image more than just your ordinary cityscape shot - I like it.  I think if the colored reflections in the water had not been long enough to extend into your foreground, it might not have been as effective a shot - the reflections seem to serve the purpose of marrying the foreground to the background.', '2007-04-12 23:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
