(3544704, 494276, 5792, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm... this image has one of those Jason-like titles. ;) Beautifully captured Superstition landscape. The lone cactus is perfect, though I''d consider a ROT positioning and/or crop for it.</td>', 'Hmmmmm... this image has one of those Jason-like titles. ;) Beautifully captured Superstition landscape. The lone cactus is perfect, though I''d consider a ROT positioning and/or crop for it.', '2007-04-13 02:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544742, 495570, 53316, '<td valign="top">Selective color to make the blacks blacker might have helped some. I do like this image a ton overall!</td>', 'Selective color to make the blacks blacker might have helped some. I do like this image a ton overall!', '2007-04-13 03:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544749, 496105, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love that with the way the branches are shaped and the shadows and stuff, I can''t tell at first if I''m seeing double or not.</td>', 'I love that with the way the branches are shaped and the shadows and stuff, I can''t tell at first if I''m seeing double or not.', '2007-04-13 03:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544755, 494741, 53316, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my shot:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=353779" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/514/thumb/353779.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/514/thumb/353779.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/514/thumb/353779.jpg"/></a> <br/>I love the understated elegance here... nice repeating pattern of figures that the viewer isn''t quite sure of what they are.... Sheesh, this picture''s so awesome it''s left me tongue tied ;-D</td>', 'Reminds me of my shot: I love the understated elegance here... nice repeating pattern of figures that the viewer isn''t quite sure of what they are.... Sheesh, this picture''s so awesome it''s left me tongue tied ;-D', '2007-04-13 03:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
