(3544775, 495899, 53316, '<td valign="top">I have such fond memories of that bridge..... I love the "imperfections" in this picture.. I mean the lights cutting through the bridge and the half-there people that some viewers might find distracting.  All the elements give the bridge a sense of realism that I like a ton.  The pink tone is great as well.</td>', 'I have such fond memories of that bridge..... I love the "imperfections" in this picture.. I mean the lights cutting through the bridge and the half-there people that some viewers might find distracting.  All the elements give the bridge a sense of realism that I like a ton.  The pink tone is great as well.', '2007-04-13 03:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544776, 495426, 49082, '<td valign="top">Like the color.</td>', 'Like the color.', '2007-04-13 03:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544777, 496055, 49082, '<td valign="top">I love the take on the contest!!</td>', 'I love the take on the contest!!', '2007-04-13 03:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
