(3544780, 495597, 53316, '<td valign="top">It definitely looks like it should... heh!  I think you did a good job with the lighting.  I can believe you took this at night.  However I feel like the vibrancy and energy which the subjects are displaying contradict a little with the peaceful feel of what I think of as "night".  Perhaps desaturated would have helped decrease the energy a little bit.</td>', 'It definitely looks like it should... heh!  I think you did a good job with the lighting.  I can believe you took this at night.  However I feel like the vibrancy and energy which the subjects are displaying contradict a little with the peaceful feel of what I think of as "night".  Perhaps desaturated would have helped decrease the energy a little bit.', '2007-04-13 03:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544781, 496112, 49082, '<td valign="top">Right at home. Oceanside Pier....practically my second home.</td>', 'Right at home. Oceanside Pier....practically my second home.', '2007-04-13 03:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544783, 495903, 49082, '<td valign="top">Looks a little too sharp, so it makes it look unnatural...but I also get the connection to the composition because it is a cross. Good job.</td>', 'Looks a little too sharp, so it makes it look unnatural...but I also get the connection to the composition because it is a cross. Good job.', '2007-04-13 03:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
