(3544885, 495314, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better light trails shots I''ve seen. The inclusion of the road gives it some solid context, yet it remains simple and to the point, nicely un-cluttered. It is a good, sound composition, and yes, works well as abstract for me. Well done :-)</td>', 'This is one of the better light trails shots I''ve seen. The inclusion of the road gives it some solid context, yet it remains simple and to the point, nicely un-cluttered. It is a good, sound composition, and yes, works well as abstract for me. Well done :-)', '2007-04-13 05:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544888, 493256, 19831, '<td valign="top">good job on exposure. And nicely composed with a good line and a vanishing point to draw the viewer across the image. Nice job.</td>', 'good job on exposure. And nicely composed with a good line and a vanishing point to draw the viewer across the image. Nice job.', '2007-04-13 05:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544889, 494188, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections and a good use of a vanishing point. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice reflections and a good use of a vanishing point. Nice job.', '2007-04-13 05:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544890, 493644, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject. This is a case where I think getting the bridge and horizon line away from the center of frame could make for a greater impact. You could probably afford to lose a little sky, since the interest is in the bridge and the reflections in the water, thus moving the line above center, closer to the top thirds line.</td>', 'Good choice of subject. This is a case where I think getting the bridge and horizon line away from the center of frame could make for a greater impact. You could probably afford to lose a little sky, since the interest is in the bridge and the reflections in the water, thus moving the line above center, closer to the top thirds line.', '2007-04-13 05:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544893, 493980, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool shot and nice job on exposure. Really like the colors and tones. A refreshing approach to the challenge. Nice job.</td>', 'Cool shot and nice job on exposure. Really like the colors and tones. A refreshing approach to the challenge. Nice job.', '2007-04-13 05:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544903, 496001, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you are going for here, kind of a ''typical slice of night life'' type thing, which is actually quite a good idea, and you''re close, but it just doesn''t feel like it is all coming together in this case. The placement of the vehicle (on the lower left thirds intersection) in the composition makes one want to view it as a main subject, yet there is the pedestrian crossing sign post as a distraction in front of and disecting it. The bright white Chase Rd sign, being the brightest point in the scene strongly draws the viewers eye, and yet it is not in the focal plane, so I feel it leaves the viewer in their mind, a little confused as to the theme. In all, a nice idea, and a little more diligence to the choice of the layout of the scene could make a greater impact.</td>', 'I think I see what you are going for here, kind of a ''typical slice of night life'' type thing, which is actually quite a good idea, and you''re close, but it just doesn''t feel like it is all coming together in this case. The placement of the vehicle (on the lower left thirds intersection) in the composition makes one want to view it as a main subject, yet there is the pedestrian crossing sign post as a distraction in front of and disecting it. The bright white Chase Rd sign, being the brightest point in the scene strongly draws the viewers eye, and yet it is not in the focal plane, so I feel it leaves the viewer in their mind, a little confused as to the theme. In all, a nice idea, and a little more diligence to the choice of the layout of the scene could make a greater impact.', '2007-04-13 05:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544912, 495593, 19831, '<td valign="top">Now this shot''s kinda cool. I like seeing the colors in a night shot, and good detail in the dark foreground. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Now this shot''s kinda cool. I like seeing the colors in a night shot, and good detail in the dark foreground. Nice job :-)', '2007-04-13 05:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3544918, 496075, 19831, '<td valign="top">The lighting, and the colors, and the perspective of the bridge here are just totally great. Oh how I wish that the arch was not smack dab in the middle of the frame :-( If about 20-25 percent of the left of this shot were cropped/framed out, I really honestly feel this would be a much, much stronger composition.</td>', 'The lighting, and the colors, and the perspective of the bridge here are just totally great. Oh how I wish that the arch was not smack dab in the middle of the frame :-( If about 20-25 percent of the left of this shot were cropped/framed out, I really honestly feel this would be a much, much stronger composition.', '2007-04-13 05:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
