(3545178, 494276, 24073, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, probably my favorite so far.  The only thing is...I would of liked to see the cactus more left.  Maybe a thirds rule would of been nice.  GL.  I''m sure I won''t be the first person to mention this, and I know all to well how aggravating it can be to hear the same thing over and over, but apply the changes to a future shot, and you will have yourself a 8+ from me.  Take care.</td>', 'I love this shot, probably my favorite so far.  The only thing is...I would of liked to see the cactus more left.  Maybe a thirds rule would of been nice.  GL.  I''m sure I won''t be the first person to mention this, and I know all to well how aggravating it can be to hear the same thing over and over, but apply the changes to a future shot, and you will have yourself a 8+ from me.  Take care.', '2007-04-13 09:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
