(3546021, 493136, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering how you are fairing in this challenge.  I really like your photo and the overall darkness is so fitting.  I just love that burst of light and the atmosphere that you captured.  I hope you are not getting "too much negative space" comments, as this really is wonderfully balanced and composed.  9</td>', 'I''m wondering how you are fairing in this challenge.  I really like your photo and the overall darkness is so fitting.  I just love that burst of light and the atmosphere that you captured.  I hope you are not getting "too much negative space" comments, as this really is wonderfully balanced and composed.  9', '2007-04-13 17:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
