(3546309, 495618, 66952, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and original. I like the colors and mood. The image looks a little cluttered, it''s hard to figure out what I''m supposed to be looking at.</td>', 'Very interesting and original. I like the colors and mood. The image looks a little cluttered, it''s hard to figure out what I''m supposed to be looking at.', '2007-04-13 20:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546311, 494940, 66952, '<td valign="top">I really like the blue color, and the composition is nice. The picture is fuzzy, though, either out of focus, or the camera moved a bit during the exposure.</td>', 'I really like the blue color, and the composition is nice. The picture is fuzzy, though, either out of focus, or the camera moved a bit during the exposure.', '2007-04-13 20:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546316, 495394, 66952, '<td valign="top">You used the rule of 3rds well here. My eye keeps being drawn to the street sign, because it''s the brightest and has the most contrast. I''m not sure if that''s what you really intended, or if the subject is supposed to be the sky or trees.</td>', 'You used the rule of 3rds well here. My eye keeps being drawn to the street sign, because it''s the brightest and has the most contrast. I''m not sure if that''s what you really intended, or if the subject is supposed to be the sky or trees.', '2007-04-13 20:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546318, 495705, 66952, '<td valign="top">Interesting graphic image. I like the colors, and the feeling of motion on the river. The bright parts may be too bright.</td>', 'Interesting graphic image. I like the colors, and the feeling of motion on the river. The bright parts may be too bright.', '2007-04-13 20:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546321, 496043, 66952, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this image 3 or 4 times. It''s grown on me each time. The juxtaposition of the geometric patterns of the fence and the vines is really interesting, and I''d like to see more of that.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this image 3 or 4 times. It''s grown on me each time. The juxtaposition of the geometric patterns of the fence and the vines is really interesting, and I''d like to see more of that.', '2007-04-13 20:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546326, 495783, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, with all of the lines leading towards the mosque. Looking at it, though, it looks like it''s a bit noisy, and there isn''t really enough contrast. None of the colors is really black, even though it''s a night shot.</td>', 'I like the composition, with all of the lines leading towards the mosque. Looking at it, though, it looks like it''s a bit noisy, and there isn''t really enough contrast. None of the colors is really black, even though it''s a night shot.', '2007-04-13 20:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546331, 496068, 66952, '<td valign="top">The colors and lighting are nice. However, the bottom half of the picture is really busy, and it''s hard to focus on any one thing.</td>', 'The colors and lighting are nice. However, the bottom half of the picture is really busy, and it''s hard to focus on any one thing.', '2007-04-13 20:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546337, 494575, 66952, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice, lighting is nice, and I like the reflections on the water. Maybe this would work better as a panorama, but I think you''re trying to get too much into the shot. The bridge and the city skyline are all too small to really see anything interesting, and there''s too much sky and water.</td>', 'Colors are nice, lighting is nice, and I like the reflections on the water. Maybe this would work better as a panorama, but I think you''re trying to get too much into the shot. The bridge and the city skyline are all too small to really see anything interesting, and there''s too much sky and water.', '2007-04-13 20:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546348, 494542, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and composition. The subject matter really stands out among all the city skylines. But it looks kinda static. I''m thinking it would be a more interesting picture if you could give the feel of the fair, maybe with some people moving around, or the ride in motion, or something like that.</td>', 'I like the colors and composition. The subject matter really stands out among all the city skylines. But it looks kinda static. I''m thinking it would be a more interesting picture if you could give the feel of the fair, maybe with some people moving around, or the ride in motion, or something like that.', '2007-04-13 20:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546353, 495160, 66952, '<td valign="top">The lighting and colors are excellent, but it gives me vertigo to look at it. Something like this should probably be shot from a higher vantage point, or at least farther away. That would help with the focus issues on the top of the tower, too.</td>', 'The lighting and colors are excellent, but it gives me vertigo to look at it. Something like this should probably be shot from a higher vantage point, or at least farther away. That would help with the focus issues on the top of the tower, too.', '2007-04-13 20:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546357, 494938, 66952, '<td valign="top">Cool! It looks like a big, fireworks palm tree. It really stands out against the dark sky. The only criticism I would have is that the top''s cut off, but I''m sure you knew that already.</td>', 'Cool! It looks like a big, fireworks palm tree. It really stands out against the dark sky. The only criticism I would have is that the top''s cut off, but I''m sure you knew that already.', '2007-04-13 20:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546359, 496103, 66952, '<td valign="top">Very cool purple color and pyramid shape. The stars are nice too, but the amount of noise in the sky pulls my focus away from the stars. Looking forward to coming back after the challenge and finding out what this is.</td>', 'Very cool purple color and pyramid shape. The stars are nice too, but the amount of noise in the sky pulls my focus away from the stars. Looking forward to coming back after the challenge and finding out what this is.', '2007-04-13 20:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546367, 495564, 66952, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure. The moving stars and clouds work really well. I''m not sure the fence in the foreground really buys you much. It doesn''t frame or really lead to the mountains, and it keeps pulling my eye away from the beautiful mountains and sky.</td>', 'Nice long exposure. The moving stars and clouds work really well. I''m not sure the fence in the foreground really buys you much. It doesn''t frame or really lead to the mountains, and it keeps pulling my eye away from the beautiful mountains and sky.', '2007-04-13 21:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546371, 493294, 66952, '<td valign="top">The cranes are interesting, but they''re too small a part of the picture.</td>', 'The cranes are interesting, but they''re too small a part of the picture.', '2007-04-13 21:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546499, 496073, 69722, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. Love the colors. Love the balance. Love the frame. (I''ve always loved looking into people''s lit up windows as I walked down a street at night.) 9</td>', 'I love this photo. Love the colors. Love the balance. Love the frame. (I''ve always loved looking into people''s lit up windows as I walked down a street at night.) 9', '2007-04-13 22:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
