(3546804, 496052, 24454, '<td valign="top">Whooooahh. . . .It''s about time we had another Northern Lights photo on our home page with a ribbon under it :)  There is nothing in all the earth so beautiful and for a night challenge. .. .this HAS to win!!!   10</td>', 'Whooooahh. . . .It''s about time we had another Northern Lights photo on our home page with a ribbon under it :)  There is nothing in all the earth so beautiful and for a night challenge. .. .this HAS to win!!!   10', '2007-04-14 01:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546806, 494188, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!  Are you sick of seeing that comment yet?????  Sorry.  It was involuntary.   What a flawless, exquisite night photo.   I don''t want to go on and on with cliche''s.. . so I''ll just say 10!!  (of course!)</td>', 'Wow!!!  Are you sick of seeing that comment yet?????  Sorry.  It was involuntary.   What a flawless, exquisite night photo.   I don''t want to go on and on with cliche''s.. . so I''ll just say 10!!  (of course!)', '2007-04-14 01:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
