(3546814, 496065, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m afraid any superlative gushing about this photo would just sound like a bunch of cliche''s. . .What can you say except it is photographic perfection!  I wish I could give it a 20!!   And I feel pretty sure that all that green will be complimented by blue at the end of the week!  Congratulations!</td>', 'Well, I''m afraid any superlative gushing about this photo would just sound like a bunch of cliche''s. . .What can you say except it is photographic perfection!  I wish I could give it a 20!!   And I feel pretty sure that all that green will be complimented by blue at the end of the week!  Congratulations!', '2007-04-14 01:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546816, 494809, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this photo alot!  Everything from the old timey hat boxes to the outfit to the train station.  It all makes for such beautiful nostalgia.   Fabulous job!</td>', 'I love the feel of this photo alot!  Everything from the old timey hat boxes to the outfit to the train station.  It all makes for such beautiful nostalgia.   Fabulous job!', '2007-04-14 01:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
