(3546823, 495570, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooh. . . I really love this one.  The abstract composition really makes it more than a photo taken at night.  It''s art. . . and very nice, wall-hanging art at that!</td>', 'Ooooh. . . I really love this one.  The abstract composition really makes it more than a photo taken at night.  It''s art. . . and very nice, wall-hanging art at that!', '2007-04-14 01:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
