(3546828, 494938, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is S0 AWESOME!  I love the amazing perspective that the oh-so-tiny people on the field give this.   How impressive that must have been up close!</td>', 'This is S0 AWESOME!  I love the amazing perspective that the oh-so-tiny people on the field give this.   How impressive that must have been up close!', '2007-04-14 01:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546830, 495681, 24454, '<td valign="top">It sure doesn''t look dirty to me.  It looks clean, crisp: AWESOME!  The beautiful energy in this photo is what makes it so appealing!  Fantastic job.</td>', 'It sure doesn''t look dirty to me.  It looks clean, crisp: AWESOME!  The beautiful energy in this photo is what makes it so appealing!  Fantastic job.', '2007-04-14 02:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546833, 495903, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a powerful photo!  The cross is so beautiful illuminated like that!  It reminds me of the symbolic illumination that it represents too!  I love this for technical reasons, for artistic reasons, and for personal reasons!  10</td>', 'Wow!  What a powerful photo!  The cross is so beautiful illuminated like that!  It reminds me of the symbolic illumination that it represents too!  I love this for technical reasons, for artistic reasons, and for personal reasons!  10', '2007-04-14 02:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
