(3546838, 494180, 24454, '<td valign="top">How PRETTY!!!  No. .How GORGEOUS!!!  The lighting and focus are perfect!  The range of tones is amazing how you can see detail in even the shadows, yet not a trace of over-exposure is seen in the lights.  You did a fantastic job on this!   And that little church is so awesome.  Kind of a beautiful little anachronism.</td>', 'How PRETTY!!!  No. .How GORGEOUS!!!  The lighting and focus are perfect!  The range of tones is amazing how you can see detail in even the shadows, yet not a trace of over-exposure is seen in the lights.  You did a fantastic job on this!   And that little church is so awesome.  Kind of a beautiful little anachronism.', '2007-04-14 02:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546841, 494624, 24454, '<td valign="top">I LOVE photos like this!  You did a fantastic job!  Excellent lighting.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'I LOVE photos like this!  You did a fantastic job!  Excellent lighting.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2007-04-14 02:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3546843, 493289, 24454, '<td valign="top">How awesome is that!  I love that angle!  And what amazing focus, with perfect lighting!</td>', 'How awesome is that!  I love that angle!  And what amazing focus, with perfect lighting!', '2007-04-14 02:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
