(3546851, 495950, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is is such a beautiful scene!  The lighting and focus are perfect!<br/> <br/>Good luck!  I really love this one!</td>', 'Wow!  This is is such a beautiful scene!  The lighting and focus are perfect! Good luck!  I really love this one!', '2007-04-14 02:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547028, 495363, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool image! Very refreshing in this challenge with all the cityscape shots. Love the blue tones. Good composition. This has a very other-worldly, yet serene feeling. Great job :-)</td>', 'Very cool image! Very refreshing in this challenge with all the cityscape shots. Love the blue tones. Good composition. This has a very other-worldly, yet serene feeling. Great job :-)', '2007-04-14 06:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547030, 494575, 19831, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflections. Nice cityscape shot. Good job.</td>', 'Lovely reflections. Nice cityscape shot. Good job.', '2007-04-14 06:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547032, 495339, 19831, '<td valign="top">Hm, interesting approach to the challenge. Works for me, I see lights on, and its dark around the window, so definitely at night :-) It''s actually a cool image. It grows on me the longer I look. Kind of ''voyeuristic'', but in an innocent, kind of sweet way, if you know what I mean. I''m not sure how the general voters will receive it, but, upon consideration, I quite like it. To me, it''s an image that is easy to ''connect'' with. I say good job, and a good score from me :-)</td>', 'Hm, interesting approach to the challenge. Works for me, I see lights on, and its dark around the window, so definitely at night :-) It''s actually a cool image. It grows on me the longer I look. Kind of ''voyeuristic'', but in an innocent, kind of sweet way, if you know what I mean. I''m not sure how the general voters will receive it, but, upon consideration, I quite like it. To me, it''s an image that is easy to ''connect'' with. I say good job, and a good score from me :-)', '2007-04-14 06:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547035, 495777, 19831, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge. Composed and executed well. Nice job.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge. Composed and executed well. Nice job.', '2007-04-14 06:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547041, 496073, 19831, '<td valign="top">Suhweet image!!! This is cool photography. Great eye, and great job!</td>', 'Suhweet image!!! This is cool photography. Great eye, and great job!', '2007-04-14 06:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547047, 495570, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstract. I really like the ball against the primarily square, rectangular, linear shapes. The dark upper left section gives balance to the composition. And I like the feel of ''oncoming'' motion. Not sure how well it will go over with the voters in general, unfortunately, it often seems that not many people appreciate a good abstract. As for me, I dig ''em, and I think this one is pretty neat. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Very cool abstract. I really like the ball against the primarily square, rectangular, linear shapes. The dark upper left section gives balance to the composition. And I like the feel of ''oncoming'' motion. Not sure how well it will go over with the voters in general, unfortunately, it often seems that not many people appreciate a good abstract. As for me, I dig ''em, and I think this one is pretty neat. Nice job :-)', '2007-04-14 07:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547052, 496126, 318, '<td valign="top">Shame about that lamppost.</td>', 'Shame about that lamppost.', '2007-04-14 07:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547053, 495212, 19831, '<td valign="top">A nice refreshing approach to the challenge. Good job on the exposure, some of the brighter areas seem to just be on the verge of blowing out, but not bad at all. It''s definitely a good choice of subject, IMO. I''m wondering though, if maybe it were not shot so ''straight on'', from a little off to the side, more of an angle type thing, it could perhaps be a little more dynamic, maybe a little stronger impact, compositionally? Nice job though.</td>', 'A nice refreshing approach to the challenge. Good job on the exposure, some of the brighter areas seem to just be on the verge of blowing out, but not bad at all. It''s definitely a good choice of subject, IMO. I''m wondering though, if maybe it were not shot so ''straight on'', from a little off to the side, more of an angle type thing, it could perhaps be a little more dynamic, maybe a little stronger impact, compositionally? Nice job though.', '2007-04-14 07:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547054, 496133, 19831, '<td valign="top">Is that woody? Cool shot :-)</td>', 'Is that woody? Cool shot :-)', '2007-04-14 07:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547059, 495642, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is very, very cool. I''ve looked for several minutes, and I just don''t know what else to say other than, this is very, very cool. This makes me think J.J. Beguin, and that my friend, is a HUGE compliment from me. <br/> <br/>It breaks a big ''rule'', with the people cut off, but it works perfect that way. The light is just to die for in the shot. Texture, mood, just wow. The dof works great. It just all comes together, and is just an incredible image. It is just undescribable how this image has grabbed me by my very soul. Going into my favs, and thank-you, thank-you for such an amazing photograph.</td>', 'Wow. This is very, very cool. I''ve looked for several minutes, and I just don''t know what else to say other than, this is very, very cool. This makes me think J.J. Beguin, and that my friend, is a HUGE compliment from me.  It breaks a big ''rule'', with the people cut off, but it works perfect that way. The light is just to die for in the shot. Texture, mood, just wow. The dof works great. It just all comes together, and is just an incredible image. It is just undescribable how this image has grabbed me by my very soul. Going into my favs, and thank-you, thank-you for such an amazing photograph.', '2007-04-14 07:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
