(3547549, 496075, 57202, '<td valign="top">Sweet!!!  The balance between the lit foreground, the colors of the bridge, and the sky is awesome.  If you ask me, this needs to be in the top 5.  An incredible shot, and without using the Northern Lights... :)</td>', 'Sweet!!!  The balance between the lit foreground, the colors of the bridge, and the sky is awesome.  If you ask me, this needs to be in the top 5.  An incredible shot, and without using the Northern Lights... :)', '2007-04-14 16:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
