(3547569, 496046, 57202, '<td valign="top">Damn you Northerners!  *shakes fist* ;)  Beautiful exposure of the sky and good choice of relatively short shutter speed to keep the stars looking like stars.  I only wish that the foreground was lighter.  If it''s an option next time, take the shot somewhere that''s snowy.  Snow does a GREAT job of lighting up under moonlight. :)</td>', 'Damn you Northerners!  *shakes fist* ;)  Beautiful exposure of the sky and good choice of relatively short shutter speed to keep the stars looking like stars.  I only wish that the foreground was lighter.  If it''s an option next time, take the shot somewhere that''s snowy.  Snow does a GREAT job of lighting up under moonlight. :)', '2007-04-14 16:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547570, 495497, 57202, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and great reflections off the still water. :)</td>', 'Nice exposure and great reflections off the still water. :)', '2007-04-14 16:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
