(3547874, 494747, 9690, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I think the lighting on their faces (and the bit coming from the porch light) should be the focus.  The top of the door are lit up to much, and its distracts the eye from the couple.  Especially since the frame is a bright white.  But overall, I like the feel and the potential this photo has.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I think the lighting on their faces (and the bit coming from the porch light) should be the focus.  The top of the door are lit up to much, and its distracts the eye from the couple.  Especially since the frame is a bright white.  But overall, I like the feel and the potential this photo has.', '2007-04-14 20:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3547877, 496068, 9690, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the image comes off a bit flat.  Since the bridge runs strictly left to right, theres a one-dimensionality to it.</td>', 'Nice, but the image comes off a bit flat.  Since the bridge runs strictly left to right, theres a one-dimensionality to it.', '2007-04-14 20:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
