(3547885, 495587, 9690, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... There''s no central focus to this image.  Without it, the eye can''t really settle on anything.  Plus, the dark areas are under-exposed, while you have some blown out areas in the middle of the pic.</td>', 'Hmmmm... There''s no central focus to this image.  Without it, the eye can''t really settle on anything.  Plus, the dark areas are under-exposed, while you have some blown out areas in the middle of the pic.', '2007-04-14 20:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
