(3547901, 495835, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat image.  Doesn''t wow me as much as other skyline shots I''ve seen, but there are soooo many good ones out there.</td>', 'Neat image.  Doesn''t wow me as much as other skyline shots I''ve seen, but there are soooo many good ones out there.', '2007-04-14 20:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
