(3548335, 494261, 53316, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition!  (now that I think about it this is actually pretty phallic?)  I like how everything seems very symmetrical. With shots like this even a little bit of tilt can be devestating.  Seems a tiny tiny bit off because of the way the building has the extra part on the right but that doesn''t make me go "oh um the picture is tilted!" but instead adds to the vibrancy of the image. 10!</td>', 'Lovely composition!  (now that I think about it this is actually pretty phallic?)  I like how everything seems very symmetrical. With shots like this even a little bit of tilt can be devestating.  Seems a tiny tiny bit off because of the way the building has the extra part on the right but that doesn''t make me go "oh um the picture is tilted!" but instead adds to the vibrancy of the image. 10!', '2007-04-14 23:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
