(3548901, 494520, 33164, '<td valign="top">framing seems a bit off to me. house on the right is cut off, and causing distraction. 5</td>', 'framing seems a bit off to me. house on the right is cut off, and causing distraction. 5', '2007-04-15 09:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548912, 494809, 33164, '<td valign="top">excellent, love the choice of sepia here.  captures the era and noir like feel of it.</td>', 'excellent, love the choice of sepia here.  captures the era and noir like feel of it.', '2007-04-15 09:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548922, 496141, 40819, '<td valign="top">Great location and color. I have a problem with the lack of crisp focus. I understand how hard that is to achieve though. Try a shorter shutter speed, like a second and open up the aperture as wide as you can.<br/> <br/>BTW I really miss the towers too.</td>', 'Great location and color. I have a problem with the lack of crisp focus. I understand how hard that is to achieve though. Try a shorter shutter speed, like a second and open up the aperture as wide as you can. BTW I really miss the towers too.', '2007-04-15 09:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548926, 494776, 40819, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was shot from the new football field in Weehawaken. Nice job. I always have shot at sunset from near the Charthouse. I am going to have to get up pretty early to grab a lovely shot like this.</td>', 'This looks like it was shot from the new football field in Weehawaken. Nice job. I always have shot at sunset from near the Charthouse. I am going to have to get up pretty early to grab a lovely shot like this.', '2007-04-15 09:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548942, 494284, 33164, '<td valign="top">if you did a shutter speed about twice as long you could smooth out the headlights.  Would also brighten all the dark areas and give some detail there.</td>', 'if you did a shutter speed about twice as long you could smooth out the headlights.  Would also brighten all the dark areas and give some detail there.', '2007-04-15 10:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548944, 496125, 33164, '<td valign="top">honestly, I think the Union Station sign is the worst part about this.  Everything below it is so nice, and gives such a good feel, and then there''s a neon sign.  I just feel that it takes away from the character of the building and trees.</td>', 'honestly, I think the Union Station sign is the worst part about this.  Everything below it is so nice, and gives such a good feel, and then there''s a neon sign.  I just feel that it takes away from the character of the building and trees.', '2007-04-15 10:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548971, 495618, 41047, '<td valign="top">this is very cool, i love it.</td>', 'this is very cool, i love it.', '2007-04-15 10:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548973, 494697, 61396, '<td valign="top">The sky, the water and the boats in between - they all blend into a marvel</td>', 'The sky, the water and the boats in between - they all blend into a marvel', '2007-04-15 10:40:02.000000', NULL, 1);
