(3548974, 494464, 61396, '<td valign="top">This deserves a "How did they do that" entry</td>', 'This deserves a "How did they do that" entry', '2007-04-15 10:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548977, 495630, 41047, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, i like the silvery tones.</td>', 'interesting composition, i like the silvery tones.', '2007-04-15 10:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548981, 494868, 41047, '<td valign="top">very nice composition, i loke this.</td>', 'very nice composition, i loke this.', '2007-04-15 10:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3548984, 495642, 41047, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition and light. i love this.</td>', 'beautiful composition and light. i love this.', '2007-04-15 10:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549002, 496032, 41047, '<td valign="top">the perspective is great in this pic. lovely tones as well.</td>', 'the perspective is great in this pic. lovely tones as well.', '2007-04-15 10:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549003, 495641, 41047, '<td valign="top">i love this, has a very elegant beauty to it.</td>', 'i love this, has a very elegant beauty to it.', '2007-04-15 10:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549004, 493152, 41047, '<td valign="top">great capture.</td>', 'great capture.', '2007-04-15 10:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549010, 496129, 41047, '<td valign="top">i like the contrast of movement on the street side of the sidewalk vs the stillness at the cafe. very nice capture.</td>', 'i like the contrast of movement on the street side of the sidewalk vs the stillness at the cafe. very nice capture.', '2007-04-15 11:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549063, 494085, 9690, '<td valign="top">This thing sure has been popular on DPC lateley!  Nice shot!  But shots of the eye may be getting a bit played out.  I love the contrast of colors.</td>', 'This thing sure has been popular on DPC lateley!  Nice shot!  But shots of the eye may be getting a bit played out.  I love the contrast of colors.', '2007-04-15 11:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549064, 495803, 75122, '<td valign="top">i think for me there is to much grain...maybe to high of an ISO...i ran into the same prob. with my photo.  And the midtones are to grayed out..it needs some more contrast between the pure whites and pure blacks</td>', 'i think for me there is to much grain...maybe to high of an ISO...i ran into the same prob. with my photo.  And the midtones are to grayed out..it needs some more contrast between the pure whites and pure blacks', '2007-04-15 11:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549067, 494094, 9690, '<td valign="top">Soft focus, overall.  And the sunset was not particularly spectacular on this day.  Looks like a good spot, however, when the right sky comes along!</td>', 'Soft focus, overall.  And the sunset was not particularly spectacular on this day.  Looks like a good spot, however, when the right sky comes along!', '2007-04-15 11:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549070, 495642, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat image and idea, but I think I would have used a greater DOF in this one.</td>', 'Neat image and idea, but I think I would have used a greater DOF in this one.', '2007-04-15 11:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549073, 495563, 9690, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the lighting contrast is a bit too much for one to really take the image in for what it is.</td>', 'Good composition, but the lighting contrast is a bit too much for one to really take the image in for what it is.', '2007-04-15 11:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549076, 494261, 71258, '<td valign="top">Nicely put together. Great Job!</td>', 'Nicely put together. Great Job!', '2007-04-15 11:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549077, 495649, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat capture.  It looks rather pixelated, however, in the smoke, fire, and sky.  Could be oversharpening or just a really low-resolution image to begin with.</td>', 'Neat capture.  It looks rather pixelated, however, in the smoke, fire, and sky.  Could be oversharpening or just a really low-resolution image to begin with.', '2007-04-15 11:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549083, 495986, 9690, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Would be a bit more interesting with more people in it (or the one what is there to stand out a bit more).  The white light from the board is a bit overbearing, but nothing you could do about that.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Would be a bit more interesting with more people in it (or the one what is there to stand out a bit more).  The white light from the board is a bit overbearing, but nothing you could do about that.', '2007-04-15 11:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549088, 493898, 9690, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W shot.  Nice treatment in converting it.  Very nicely exposed, as well.  There are no glaring, burned out spots.  The only thing that could be fixed (not in basic editing) is the black sky.  Some of the light appears to "bleed" upwards.  But out of all the city-scenes in this challenge, this is one of my favs.</td>', 'Great B&W shot.  Nice treatment in converting it.  Very nicely exposed, as well.  There are no glaring, burned out spots.  The only thing that could be fixed (not in basic editing) is the black sky.  Some of the light appears to "bleed" upwards.  But out of all the city-scenes in this challenge, this is one of my favs.', '2007-04-15 11:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549089, 495907, 71258, '<td valign="top">The reflections of each light pole look like fire dripping off a candle. It would be a little better to see more light on the dark shore. IMO. But overall... Nice Job!</td>', 'The reflections of each light pole look like fire dripping off a candle. It would be a little better to see more light on the dark shore. IMO. But overall... Nice Job!', '2007-04-15 11:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549090, 494678, 75122, '<td valign="top">the focus is not quite there</td>', 'the focus is not quite there', '2007-04-15 11:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549091, 495794, 9690, '<td valign="top">The candle is a bit too harsh on the left side.  Maybe a little bit of fill light on the rest of the scene could have balanced it out.</td>', 'The candle is a bit too harsh on the left side.  Maybe a little bit of fill light on the rest of the scene could have balanced it out.', '2007-04-15 11:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549093, 492894, 9690, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit too grainy.  Nice composition, however.</td>', 'Looks a bit too grainy.  Nice composition, however.', '2007-04-15 11:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549094, 494052, 9690, '<td valign="top">How odd.  A night shot where you choose to "light up the night."  Neat take on the challenge.  The image is not very sharp, however, and it comes off a bit flat.</td>', 'How odd.  A night shot where you choose to "light up the night."  Neat take on the challenge.  The image is not very sharp, however, and it comes off a bit flat.', '2007-04-15 11:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549096, 495835, 71258, '<td valign="top">Love the reflections. Is that a crane on top of the building to the far left? Nice choice of subject.</td>', 'Love the reflections. Is that a crane on top of the building to the far left? Nice choice of subject.', '2007-04-15 11:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549098, 496135, 9690, '<td valign="top">Beautful colors!  The overall softness, however doesn''t work for me here.  And the left side is a bit overexposed, making it stand out too much.</td>', 'Beautful colors!  The overall softness, however doesn''t work for me here.  And the left side is a bit overexposed, making it stand out too much.', '2007-04-15 11:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549099, 496129, 71258, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, Dramatic. Good Job!</td>', 'Great perspective, Dramatic. Good Job!', '2007-04-15 11:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549101, 496062, 9690, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  I can only imagine what could be done if this wasnt basic editing!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  I can only imagine what could be done if this wasnt basic editing!', '2007-04-15 11:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549104, 493289, 71258, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2007-04-15 11:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3549105, 494336, 75122, '<td valign="top">Great shot, only thing that bothers me is that boat, for me its distracting to the eye as i try to view the pier railing.  But then again, its not like you could go move the boat!</td>', 'Great shot, only thing that bothers me is that boat, for me its distracting to the eye as i try to view the pier railing.  But then again, its not like you could go move the boat!', '2007-04-15 11:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
