(3553258, 495998, 35750, '<td valign="top">I like the stars on the right-side light posts.<br/> <br/>About the taillights, I wander if the skip-pattern is due to new led technology. I had this same thing shooting the other night.</td>', 'I like the stars on the right-side light posts. About the taillights, I wander if the skip-pattern is due to new led technology. I had this same thing shooting the other night.', '2007-04-16 18:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
