(3553292, 493289, 35750, '<td valign="top">Cimplicity can be accepted...<br/>Nice one.</td>', 'Cimplicity can be accepted...Nice one.', '2007-04-16 18:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3553293, 496134, 66952, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, I like the statue, and the street leading up to the building. The dark buildings blend into the black sky too much, though. It''s impossible to tell where the buildings stop and the sky begins. I think it would be better if it had been taken a little earlier in the evening, to make the sky bluer, and get more definition to the buildings.</td>', 'The idea is good, I like the statue, and the street leading up to the building. The dark buildings blend into the black sky too much, though. It''s impossible to tell where the buildings stop and the sky begins. I think it would be better if it had been taken a little earlier in the evening, to make the sky bluer, and get more definition to the buildings.', '2007-04-16 18:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3553296, 496030, 66952, '<td valign="top">The white tree is very cool. The totally blown out street light doesn''t really work, because it draws too much attention away from the tree.</td>', 'The white tree is very cool. The totally blown out street light doesn''t really work, because it draws too much attention away from the tree.', '2007-04-16 18:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3553313, 495989, 66952, '<td valign="top">hmmm....It''s definitely night, so it meets the challenge. Everything that''s visible is nice and sharp. I think there might be too much going on in the shot...the store, the truck, and the traffic lights are all competing for attention.</td>', 'hmmm....It''s definitely night, so it meets the challenge. Everything that''s visible is nice and sharp. I think there might be too much going on in the shot...the store, the truck, and the traffic lights are all competing for attention.', '2007-04-16 19:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3553320, 493144, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the nice shape and detail on the tree silhouette. It''s hard to take night shots with the moon, because the moon is actually very bright, and by the time the rest of the scene is properly lit, the moon will be totally blown out, which seems to be what has happened here. The moon has just turned into a white blob.</td>', 'I like the nice shape and detail on the tree silhouette. It''s hard to take night shots with the moon, because the moon is actually very bright, and by the time the rest of the scene is properly lit, the moon will be totally blown out, which seems to be what has happened here. The moon has just turned into a white blob.', '2007-04-16 19:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3553327, 495906, 32790, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, I love this one!</td>', 'Gorgeous, I love this one!', '2007-04-16 19:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3553328, 494443, 9478, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but this it does not fit in the challenge.</td>', 'Good picture, but this it does not fit in the challenge.', '2007-04-16 19:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3553334, 494261, 32790, '<td valign="top">I love the symmetry and colors in this photo, reminds me somehow of one of those cartoonish movies (like batman''s gotham city, sin city, etc etc.) Probably because the building in the back looks surreal. I love it!</td>', 'I love the symmetry and colors in this photo, reminds me somehow of one of those cartoonish movies (like batman''s gotham city, sin city, etc etc.) Probably because the building in the back looks surreal. I love it!', '2007-04-16 19:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
