(3554226, 495160, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this subject has some potential, but this shot isn''t bringing it out.<br/> <br/>First, the centered composition isn''t too interesting.  Show us some context - for example, is the moon off to one side, or some stars?<br/> <br/>Second, it''s pretty blurry.  You really need to use a tripod or put the camera down to take good night shots.  You lose some visual interest because the bricks aren''t clear.<br/> <br/>Third, the lighting is ... not especially engaging.<br/> <br/>Good effort, though - keep shooting and trying different things. :)</td>', 'I''m sure this subject has some potential, but this shot isn''t bringing it out. First, the centered composition isn''t too interesting.  Show us some context - for example, is the moon off to one side, or some stars? Second, it''s pretty blurry.  You really need to use a tripod or put the camera down to take good night shots.  You lose some visual interest because the bricks aren''t clear. Third, the lighting is ... not especially engaging. Good effort, though - keep shooting and trying different things. :)', '2007-04-17 01:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3554227, 496113, 45968, '<td valign="top">Way to make such an ugly place look amazingly beautiful</td>', 'Way to make such an ugly place look amazingly beautiful', '2007-04-17 01:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
