(3554233, 494085, 60862, '<td valign="top">So, did you see the winning Spinning shot and figured you''d try it?  Either way, it''s just not as good.  I think it''s because the Eye is much smaller here.  The blue lights are pretty, though.</td>', 'So, did you see the winning Spinning shot and figured you''d try it?  Either way, it''s just not as good.  I think it''s because the Eye is much smaller here.  The blue lights are pretty, though.', '2007-04-17 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
