(3554336, 495827, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. I like the silhouette thing going on. I''m thinking that perhaps compositionally, the image could maybe have a greater impact if some of the negative space at bottom were cropped out. I think it could geve the balance more weight, and a less ''centered'' feel.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. I like the silhouette thing going on. I''m thinking that perhaps compositionally, the image could maybe have a greater impact if some of the negative space at bottom were cropped out. I think it could geve the balance more weight, and a less ''centered'' feel.', '2007-04-17 02:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
