(3554837, 496134, 21500, '<td valign="top">I miss Philly, such a unique city with so much character.  There are great cityscapes to be had at night from Spring Garden bridge - right next to the art museum.  Check the white balance to ensure the city is white, not yellow and enjoy (best when the trees are in full bloom and you can capture the summer humidity in the air)!</td>', 'I miss Philly, such a unique city with so much character.  There are great cityscapes to be had at night from Spring Garden bridge - right next to the art museum.  Check the white balance to ensure the city is white, not yellow and enjoy (best when the trees are in full bloom and you can capture the summer humidity in the air)!', '2007-04-17 10:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3554838, 495588, 21500, '<td valign="top">There are some great shots from the KL Tower too, so long as you don''t use a flash and can put the camera up to the window to block the inside light.  Thanks for the photo!</td>', 'There are some great shots from the KL Tower too, so long as you don''t use a flash and can put the camera up to the window to block the inside light.  Thanks for the photo!', '2007-04-17 10:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
