(3558199, 494542, 5792, '<td valign="top">Positives:<br/>Colorful composition that conveys a sense of a fair. Technicals are good.<br/> <br/>Technicals:<br/>Colors are vibrant, the very deep blue sky background is very nice. Well composed image. It does not have any distracting digital artifacts but might be very slightly soft focused, but that might just be me because I like ultrasharpened images. The angle on the sign is a little to ''edge on'' making it unreadable and on the busy side. Almost looks overexposed on the white neon. It may not be but the image is bright in that area.<br/> <br/>The Challenge:<br/>Meets the challenge but that is never enough at DPC. An image needs something special to set it apart from the rest.<br/> <br/>It scored about .2 below the DPC average. I gave it a 7 but that is the score I give an average DPC image. So basically, both the voters and I agree, we just express it a little differently.<br/> <br/>Suggestions:<br/>Try a slightly different angle further to the right of the sign so voters can better distinguish the neon lettering detail. Might not make it look so bright either.<br/> <br/>A fair needs people and/or fairway action to provide a full effect and the lack of either in the composition might have subconciously contributed to giving it an average score. Something you could try is a taking long timed exposure when the background wheel is in motion to show a lot of rotation.</td>', 'Positives:Colorful composition that conveys a sense of a fair. Technicals are good. Technicals:Colors are vibrant, the very deep blue sky background is very nice. Well composed image. It does not have any distracting digital artifacts but might be very slightly soft focused, but that might just be me because I like ultrasharpened images. The angle on the sign is a little to ''edge on'' making it unreadable and on the busy side. Almost looks overexposed on the white neon. It may not be but the image is bright in that area. The Challenge:Meets the challenge but that is never enough at DPC. An image needs something special to set it apart from the rest. It scored about .2 below the DPC average. I gave it a 7 but that is the score I give an average DPC image. So basically, both the voters and I agree, we just express it a little differently. Suggestions:Try a slightly different angle further to the right of the sign so voters can better distinguish the neon lettering detail. Might not make it look so bright either. A fair needs people and/or fairway action to provide a full effect and the lack of either in the composition might have subconciously contributed to giving it an average score. Something you could try is a taking long timed exposure when the background wheel is in motion to show a lot of rotation.', '2007-04-18 04:52:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558221, 494276, 30982, '<td valign="top">Helluva score to go with that there pretty blue ribbon!  I do have to say on first glance it looked like that cactus was flipping you off...  :-)  Nice job and congrats!</td>', 'Helluva score to go with that there pretty blue ribbon!  I do have to say on first glance it looked like that cactus was flipping you off...  :-)  Nice job and congrats!', '2007-04-18 05:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558235, 493794, 20124, '<td valign="top"><br/> I cannot believe some people''s comments.<br/> <br/>Of course I used flash to take this picture! If I didn''t<br/> <br/>use flash the photo would be pitch black. It is very<br/> <br/>obvious by looking at the picture above that it was<br/> <br/>taken late at night. So what other light source can<br/> <br/>I use?  Seriously folks, let''s think before we leave<br/> <br/>comments.  And for those that didn''t find this interesting.<br/> <br/>That''s a matter of opinion. Very subjective. I''m sure<br/> <br/>If I looked at your portfolio, it''s very likely  <br/> <br/>that I would find boring photos there as well.</td>', ' I cannot believe some people''s comments. Of course I used flash to take this picture! If I didn''t use flash the photo would be pitch black. It is very obvious by looking at the picture above that it was taken late at night. So what other light source can I use?  Seriously folks, let''s think before we leave comments.  And for those that didn''t find this interesting. That''s a matter of opinion. Very subjective. I''m sure If I looked at your portfolio, it''s very likely   that I would find boring photos there as well.', '2007-04-18 05:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558240, 493170, 20124, '<td valign="top">Too much noise and too blurry. Another city scape shot?<br/> <br/> There''s an original idea for a night shot lol</td>', 'Too much noise and too blurry. Another city scape shot?  There''s an original idea for a night shot lol', '2007-04-18 05:46:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558243, 495702, 20124, '<td valign="top">I know someone has said this already, but it''s blurry.<br/> <br/> and where''s the subject exactly?</td>', 'I know someone has said this already, but it''s blurry.  and where''s the subject exactly?', '2007-04-18 05:48:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558245, 494975, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - great composition and the exposure is perfect.  And I''d have known Boca Raton - my mom lived there for awhile.  In fact, there was a place somewhere in Delray Beach we used to go for lunch.  Been awhile, though!</td>', 'Excellent shot - great composition and the exposure is perfect.  And I''d have known Boca Raton - my mom lived there for awhile.  In fact, there was a place somewhere in Delray Beach we used to go for lunch.  Been awhile, though!', '2007-04-18 05:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558247, 494459, 30982, '<td valign="top">What makes this work is the perspective you chose - creates a very pleasing composition.  And the golden and brown tones of the shot work quite well, too.  Congrats on a great score!</td>', 'What makes this work is the perspective you chose - creates a very pleasing composition.  And the golden and brown tones of the shot work quite well, too.  Congrats on a great score!', '2007-04-18 05:55:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558251, 494276, 20124, '<td valign="top">Looks okay overall, but it just appears overly processed to me. IMO<br/> <br/>  Saturation and contrast are really high here. Doesn''t look natural.<br/> <br/>  I don''t even know if this photo fits the theme either. <br/> <br/>This is more of a sunset shot. Definitely not a night shot. <br/> <br/>  sunsets are easy.<br/> <br/>True night shots are much harder<br/> <br/> Congrats anyways</td>', 'Looks okay overall, but it just appears overly processed to me. IMO   Saturation and contrast are really high here. Doesn''t look natural.   I don''t even know if this photo fits the theme either.  This is more of a sunset shot. Definitely not a night shot.    sunsets are easy. True night shots are much harder  Congrats anyways', '2007-04-18 06:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558252, 495497, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very clever!  I thought this was yours but got confused when in one of the forums you said you tried something different... Then again, this *is* different!</td>', 'Very clever!  I thought this was yours but got confused when in one of the forums you said you tried something different... Then again, this *is* different!', '2007-04-18 06:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558256, 496085, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think the exposure is pretty good; I couldn''t read the sign on my monitor at home but I can on the one at work.  I can see where you wanted to include it, but maybe a shot just beyond the sign?  To me it kind of breaks up the flow of the building.</td>', 'I think the exposure is pretty good; I couldn''t read the sign on my monitor at home but I can on the one at work.  I can see where you wanted to include it, but maybe a shot just beyond the sign?  To me it kind of breaks up the flow of the building.', '2007-04-18 06:06:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558258, 496090, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, with good blue and gold tones.  I like the series of arches.</td>', 'Nicely composed, with good blue and gold tones.  I like the series of arches.', '2007-04-18 06:07:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558260, 495704, 30982, '<td valign="top">Holy cow - what a score!  This has great lines, great angles - love the composition.  Congrats!</td>', 'Holy cow - what a score!  This has great lines, great angles - love the composition.  Congrats!', '2007-04-18 06:08:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558261, 495794, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the warm tones caused by the candle.  What is the duck?  I mean, it''s a duck (or at least a likeness of a duck) but does it have another purpose, like a door stop or something?  (I like shots that make me wonder.)</td>', 'I like the warm tones caused by the candle.  What is the duck?  I mean, it''s a duck (or at least a likeness of a duck) but does it have another purpose, like a door stop or something?  (I like shots that make me wonder.)', '2007-04-18 06:10:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558262, 494085, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  Congrats on a new Personal Best!!</td>', 'Beautifully done!  Congrats on a new Personal Best!!', '2007-04-18 06:11:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558284, 495903, 69882, '<td valign="top">Thank´s for the comments, flares around the cross are heavy snowfall:), this cross are 3-4 meters high.</td>', 'Thank´s for the comments, flares around the cross are heavy snowfall:), this cross are 3-4 meters high.', '2007-04-18 06:33:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558306, 494276, 50231, '<td valign="top">Fairfield20<br/> <br/>It''s cool you don''t like it but perhaps before knocking it you could have looked at the specs of the shot. <br/> <br/>I think a 330s exposure at sunset would have blown out the shot so one would ascertain that a 5+ minute exposure with star trails must be a night shot.<br/> <br/>Just for the record this was taken at approx. 9pm long after sunset.<br/> <br/>Thanks for your congrats anyways...<br/></td>', 'Fairfield20 It''s cool you don''t like it but perhaps before knocking it you could have looked at the specs of the shot.  I think a 330s exposure at sunset would have blown out the shot so one would ascertain that a 5+ minute exposure with star trails must be a night shot. Just for the record this was taken at approx. 9pm long after sunset. Thanks for your congrats anyways...', '2007-04-18 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558323, 495212, 61679, '<td valign="top">I also think this is underrated. This was a fun image to view with lots of interesting things to explore.  The exposure and composition were well done.  Please tell me you are going to hang this one on your wall. I gave it a 9.  <br/> <br/>Tim</td>', 'I also think this is underrated. This was a fun image to view with lots of interesting things to explore.  The exposure and composition were well done.  Please tell me you are going to hang this one on your wall. I gave it a 9.   Tim', '2007-04-18 07:19:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558343, 496035, 67152, '<td valign="top">Catherine - Fantastic image - gave it a 10 during the challenge.  Excellent use of repeating theme and the lighting and color was really great.</td>', 'Catherine - Fantastic image - gave it a 10 during the challenge.  Excellent use of repeating theme and the lighting and color was really great.', '2007-04-18 07:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558397, 494276, 42567, '<td valign="top">Awesome job Waz!!!!  Congratulations on a wonderful picture!!</td>', 'Awesome job Waz!!!!  Congratulations on a wonderful picture!!', '2007-04-18 07:54:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558399, 495363, 42567, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the 3rd Enzo!  Wonderful job on this.</td>', 'Congratulations on the 3rd Enzo!  Wonderful job on this.', '2007-04-18 07:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558404, 495871, 36006, '<td valign="top">Your so tiny, maybe some 60 lbs sand bags in you back pack will keep you from falling over in high winds.<br/> <br/>I liked the shot, but, the brightness did take away from the challenge. <br/> <br/>Keep going sucker.</td>', 'Your so tiny, maybe some 60 lbs sand bags in you back pack will keep you from falling over in high winds. I liked the shot, but, the brightness did take away from the challenge.  Keep going sucker.', '2007-04-18 07:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558462, 496073, 48577, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture, Vikas. Interesting to see the mood of the people.</td>', 'Really nice picture, Vikas. Interesting to see the mood of the people.', '2007-04-18 08:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558474, 494261, 38032, '<td valign="top">I''ve been meaning to take a pic of that statue for a while.  No sense doing it now-  you''ve done it so perfectly. Way to go OHIO!</td>', 'I''ve been meaning to take a pic of that statue for a while.  No sense doing it now-  you''ve done it so perfectly. Way to go OHIO!', '2007-04-18 08:21:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558480, 495681, 73981, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.<br/> <br/>I think the brige at the end of the picture is actually on an angle like that, they are re-building it. I have to get used to resizing it because I think that made it look ''sharper'' than what it looks like full size on my PC.<br/> <br/>Still, for a 1st entry placing 27th is nice. Thanks all!!<br/> <br/>PS...while the river looks nice at night, it''s actually a toxic dump. People jump in the river after their team wins a baseball game, then go to the hospital to get shots to prevent all kinds of nasty things from happening.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. I think the brige at the end of the picture is actually on an angle like that, they are re-building it. I have to get used to resizing it because I think that made it look ''sharper'' than what it looks like full size on my PC. Still, for a 1st entry placing 27th is nice. Thanks all!! PS...while the river looks nice at night, it''s actually a toxic dump. People jump in the river after their team wins a baseball game, then go to the hospital to get shots to prevent all kinds of nasty things from happening.', '2007-04-18 08:26:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558485, 494940, 75519, '<td valign="top">Just a note, the original is quite sharp but I must have screwed something up when I scaled it down for the challenge.  That will teach me to take a better look at the copy I am submitting, rather than the original.</td>', 'Just a note, the original is quite sharp but I must have screwed something up when I scaled it down for the challenge.  That will teach me to take a better look at the copy I am submitting, rather than the original.', '2007-04-18 08:28:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558488, 494276, 53147, '<td valign="top">Way to go Waz!!! Excellent image and an outstanding score. Well done!</td>', 'Way to go Waz!!! Excellent image and an outstanding score. Well done!', '2007-04-18 08:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558490, 495363, 53147, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot Enzo! Congrats on the ribbon, the score and the bump up over 6.0! Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful shot Enzo! Congrats on the ribbon, the score and the bump up over 6.0! Well done!', '2007-04-18 08:29:47.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3558492, 494261, 53147, '<td valign="top">Excellent image - congrats on your first ribbon and a whopping new PB! Well done. GO OHIO!</td>', 'Excellent image - congrats on your first ribbon and a whopping new PB! Well done. GO OHIO!', '2007-04-18 08:30:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558495, 496051, 47378, '<td valign="top">I''ve gone over this bridge hundreds of times, and I always guessed there were some great photos to be had (I just haven''t gotten to them yet). Nicely done! You''ve set the bar pretty high for your first entry. Keep going!</td>', 'I''ve gone over this bridge hundreds of times, and I always guessed there were some great photos to be had (I just haven''t gotten to them yet). Nicely done! You''ve set the bar pretty high for your first entry. Keep going!', '2007-04-18 08:32:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558505, 494276, 39184, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the first blue ribbon by a D80.  I''m going to try some of these shots next week at the Red Rock GTG.  I''ll remember your settings and see if I can capture something as well done as this.</td>', 'Congratulations on the first blue ribbon by a D80.  I''m going to try some of these shots next week at the Red Rock GTG.  I''ll remember your settings and see if I can capture something as well done as this.', '2007-04-18 08:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558509, 494261, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and exposure!  Very glad to see you got your first ribbon with it and that it''s a very meaningful picture to you - congrats!</td>', 'Wonderful composition and exposure!  Very glad to see you got your first ribbon with it and that it''s a very meaningful picture to you - congrats!', '2007-04-18 08:42:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558535, 496073, 24454, '<td valign="top">Woo Hoooo!!   Vikas!!  CONGRATULATIONS!!!  Honorable Mention!   What an AWESOME, different take on the night challenge!   <br/> <br/></td>', 'Woo Hoooo!!   Vikas!!  CONGRATULATIONS!!!  Honorable Mention!   What an AWESOME, different take on the night challenge!    ', '2007-04-18 09:03:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558548, 494261, 54778, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the first!! Great shot!</td>', 'Congrats on the first!! Great shot!', '2007-04-18 09:11:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558560, 495704, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great shot! This was one of my favorites while voting - I gave you an 8. Love the starbursts. Congrats on your new PB!</td>', 'Great shot! This was one of my favorites while voting - I gave you an 8. Love the starbursts. Congrats on your new PB!', '2007-04-18 09:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558562, 496090, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jeb, this is beautiful! Great DOF and good control of your lighting here. BTW - you chose a fabulous frame that really enhances the photo.</td>', 'Jeb, this is beautiful! Great DOF and good control of your lighting here. BTW - you chose a fabulous frame that really enhances the photo.', '2007-04-18 09:15:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558565, 494975, 66597, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo! Great job, Julianne! WTG with that 6+ score! If you had taken this with a tripod / and the stars were just a touch sharper, I honestly think you might have had a ribbon contender with this one. Anyway, the composition is lovely here.</td>', 'Woo hoo! Great job, Julianne! WTG with that 6+ score! If you had taken this with a tripod / and the stars were just a touch sharper, I honestly think you might have had a ribbon contender with this one. Anyway, the composition is lovely here.', '2007-04-18 09:17:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558567, 495497, 66597, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo! Great score, Jeffrey! Looks very complicated - that diagram gives me nightmare flashbacks of geometry class :-) Seriously, excellent image and great job of pulling off an illusion successfully in basic editing.</td>', 'Woo hoo! Great score, Jeffrey! Looks very complicated - that diagram gives me nightmare flashbacks of geometry class :-) Seriously, excellent image and great job of pulling off an illusion successfully in basic editing.', '2007-04-18 09:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
