(3558594, 496035, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. To me, the color seems a tad too purple. Maybe it''s just my monitor.  Good job</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. To me, the color seems a tad too purple. Maybe it''s just my monitor.  Good job', '2007-04-18 09:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
