(3558641, 495339, 68256, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to thank everyone for such wonderful comments.  This was a self portrait with me and my wife that I setup. I wanted to make it look as non voyeuristic as possible but still get the point across.</td>', 'I just wanted to thank everyone for such wonderful comments.  This was a self portrait with me and my wife that I setup. I wanted to make it look as non voyeuristic as possible but still get the point across.', '2007-04-18 09:46:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3558649, 496065, 72929, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised no one noticed the ghostly face on the left side of the sky! It''s easier to see in the thumbnail.. but it definitely makes this image unique! It is like two eyes and a nose looking up and to the right, as though it were watching the rest of the aurora. I thought this image would have scored higher myself.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-18 08:53:02.</i></td>', 'I''m surprised no one noticed the ghostly face on the left side of the sky! It''s easier to see in the thumbnail.. but it definitely makes this image unique! It is like two eyes and a nose looking up and to the right, as though it were watching the rest of the aurora. I thought this image would have scored higher myself.', '2007-04-18 09:52:09.000000', '2007-04-18 09:53:02.000000', 0),
(3558665, 494085, 34938, '<td valign="top">You were robbed...this was superb. Honestly, I thought you were a top 5 chance. Perfect exposure, great perspective</td>', 'You were robbed...this was superb. Honestly, I thought you were a top 5 chance. Perfect exposure, great perspective', '2007-04-18 09:59:01.000000', NULL, 0),
