(3559348, 496052, 66223, '<td valign="top">excellent image, once again!  i''m assuming that the scores of 1, 2, and 3 are penalty-votes.  i wonder if those same voters will give penalty votes to ''cute kid,'' ''water droplet,'' ''pregnant woman''s belly,'' ''rusty railroad cars,'' ''colored pencils,'' ''sydney opera house,'' '' macro of a flower,'' ''portrait of an eagle'' and it''s companion ''face-shot of an owl''), ''hummingbird eating lunch,'' ''macro of a grasshopper head,'' ''some shot of an iguana showing detailed textures,'' ''ripples in the sand within the desert,'' ''dry dirt with cracks in it,'' ''cactus sunset,'' ''abandoned vintage car,'' ''abstract macro involving drinking straws,'' ''image of smoke'' and so on.  there is more to the art of this than just the subject matter, and i will continue to enjoy all of these images if they are well done.</td>', 'excellent image, once again!  i''m assuming that the scores of 1, 2, and 3 are penalty-votes.  i wonder if those same voters will give penalty votes to ''cute kid,'' ''water droplet,'' ''pregnant woman''s belly,'' ''rusty railroad cars,'' ''colored pencils,'' ''sydney opera house,'' '' macro of a flower,'' ''portrait of an eagle'' and it''s companion ''face-shot of an owl''), ''hummingbird eating lunch,'' ''macro of a grasshopper head,'' ''some shot of an iguana showing detailed textures,'' ''ripples in the sand within the desert,'' ''dry dirt with cracks in it,'' ''cactus sunset,'' ''abandoned vintage car,'' ''abstract macro involving drinking straws,'' ''image of smoke'' and so on.  there is more to the art of this than just the subject matter, and i will continue to enjoy all of these images if they are well done.', '2007-04-18 12:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
