into the location field of profile search here gives thirteen hits, or fourteen for you, as I would be one of them. With four members and about five or six who have participated in more than half-a-dozen challenges, you get four pictures of this:    With 150 located in London, you might expect the odd picture of the eye. You''d have to go some not to see the difference between this and the ''spinning'' one. Well done, congrats on the pb.', '2007-04-18 16:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
