(3560384, 494261, 13547, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic.  I think if I''d made voting I would have said the top hand was not quite as sharp as the rest, which is a shame, but it hardly detracts from the quality of the rest of the picture.  The composition is perfect with the building behind, and I love the way the ground at the bottom seems to be weighed down by the statue.  Can anyone else see that very slight curve?!  It really works to add something extra to the photo, somehow!  (Wow that was technical :-P)</td>', 'This is fantastic.  I think if I''d made voting I would have said the top hand was not quite as sharp as the rest, which is a shame, but it hardly detracts from the quality of the rest of the picture.  The composition is perfect with the building behind, and I love the way the ground at the bottom seems to be weighed down by the statue.  Can anyone else see that very slight curve?!  It really works to add something extra to the photo, somehow!  (Wow that was technical :-P)', '2007-04-18 17:54:27.000000', NULL, 0),
