(3560426, 496052, 70107, '<td valign="top">I completely back you up Larus, in regards to submitting these types of photographs whether people have seen this type before or not. I dont need to back mine or his opinions as to why we feel that way, but if a photographer is able to capture such authentic beauty of the North, then nobody should stop him, no matter If he or any other person has done it before. Like the saying "2 heads are better than one" well Two(or in this case more) photos of such incredible beauty and expression of creativity are better than one.<br/> <br/>Keep on Keepin'' on<br/>Jess.</td>', 'I completely back you up Larus, in regards to submitting these types of photographs whether people have seen this type before or not. I dont need to back mine or his opinions as to why we feel that way, but if a photographer is able to capture such authentic beauty of the North, then nobody should stop him, no matter If he or any other person has done it before. Like the saying "2 heads are better than one" well Two(or in this case more) photos of such incredible beauty and expression of creativity are better than one. Keep on Keepin'' onJess.', '2007-04-18 18:07:36.000000', NULL, 0),
