(3560967, 494085, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, and I don''t see any problem with people taking pictures of the same landmarks. After all, look at all the shots we have seen of the Sidney Opera House, and all the shots we have seen of the Washington, DC monuments. <br/> <br/>I like the detail of the wheel you captured, and the blue light on the walkway. I also like the people you have in this shot. Very nice, and I think the person who gave you a three just because someone else took a similar shot, is misusing the rating system.</td>', 'I like this a lot, and I don''t see any problem with people taking pictures of the same landmarks. After all, look at all the shots we have seen of the Sidney Opera House, and all the shots we have seen of the Washington, DC monuments.  I like the detail of the wheel you captured, and the blue light on the walkway. I also like the people you have in this shot. Very nice, and I think the person who gave you a three just because someone else took a similar shot, is misusing the rating system.', '2007-04-18 21:12:26.000000', NULL, 0),
