(3562147, 496052, 10275, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. All the people who left negative comments about how tired they are of Nothern Lights shots... What is wrong with these people? How on Earth can someone get tired of something so pure and beautiful. <br/> <br/>Get overyourself you neisayers! This is as good as it gets. The photo may not be the best technically, but it is still pleasure to look at! I''d like to see some photos of those who so negatively dismissed this shot.<br/> <br/>Larus, please post more for the world to see.</td>', 'I don''t get it. All the people who left negative comments about how tired they are of Nothern Lights shots... What is wrong with these people? How on Earth can someone get tired of something so pure and beautiful.  Get overyourself you neisayers! This is as good as it gets. The photo may not be the best technically, but it is still pleasure to look at! I''d like to see some photos of those who so negatively dismissed this shot. Larus, please post more for the world to see.', '2007-04-19 05:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
