(4159822, 495339, 39430, '<td valign="top">I got totally the opposite impression of this image from everyone else.  This is the sort of scene you see in a movie when there''s some phycho walking around outside, about to break in and kill them, or the guy inside has a knife that she doesn''t know about, and there''s gonna be blood soon.  I''m just waiting for something awful to happen with this photo.  I can still see what everyone else sees, but I see the unshown contrasting side as the main emotion here.  Hmm, does this mean I''m a psycho?</td>', 'I got totally the opposite impression of this image from everyone else.  This is the sort of scene you see in a movie when there''s some phycho walking around outside, about to break in and kill them, or the guy inside has a knife that she doesn''t know about, and there''s gonna be blood soon.  I''m just waiting for something awful to happen with this photo.  I can still see what everyone else sees, but I see the unshown contrasting side as the main emotion here.  Hmm, does this mean I''m a psycho?', '2007-10-11 09:32:30.000000', NULL, 0),
