(4943396, 495339, 97166, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by surfdabbler:</b></div><hr/><i> I got totally the opposite impression of this image from everyone else.  This is the sort of scene you see in a movie when there''s some phycho walking around outside, about to break in and kill them, or the guy inside has a knife that she doesn''t know about, and there''s gonna be blood soon.  I''m just waiting for something awful to happen with this photo.  I can still see what everyone else sees, but I see the unshown contrasting side as the main emotion here.  Hmm, does this mean I''m a psycho? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If you are a psycho, then I am.  That''s pretty much the first impression I got. "Why is someone peeping on these people, they''re gonna DIIIEEE!!"<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by surfdabbler: I got totally the opposite impression of this image from everyone else.  This is the sort of scene you see in a movie when there''s some phycho walking around outside, about to break in and kill them, or the guy inside has a knife that she doesn''t know about, and there''s gonna be blood soon.  I''m just waiting for something awful to happen with this photo.  I can still see what everyone else sees, but I see the unshown contrasting side as the main emotion here.  Hmm, does this mean I''m a psycho?   If you are a psycho, then I am.  That''s pretty much the first impression I got. "Why is someone peeping on these people, they''re gonna DIIIEEE!!" ', '2008-09-08 23:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
